Package: psyc350data
Title: Datasets for UNL PSYC 350 Labs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Marshall", "Emma", email = "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides cleaned and labeled datasets used in PSYC 350 lab exercises. Datasets are available as R tibbles and can be exported as SPSS (.sav) files with full variable labels, value labels, and defined missing values.
